	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "GOFORD G120N02D32 dual N-channel MOSFET, package PDFNWB-8_L3.0-W3.0-P0.65-LS3.3-BL (DFN3x3-8L Dual). Land pattern transcribed from the JLCEDA/EasyEDA official library footprint for JLCPCB part C43213314 (source: JLCEDA/EasyEDA official library, https://lceda.cn and https://easyeda.com). 8 terminals 0.40x0.70mm on 0.65mm pitch on two opposite sides; two exposed drain pads 1.00x1.80mm at x=+-0.68mm. The exposed drain pads deliberately overlap the drain terminals (by 0.215mm) so that pad + terminals form one continuous piece of drain copper: the drain is the thermal path of the part, an isolated pad or a clearance gap would leave the outer 0.3mm of the package's exposed pad unsoldered. Top view, pin 1 bottom left: 1-4 = S1/G1/S2/G2, 5-8 = D2/D2/D1/D1; the exposed drain pads reuse pad numbers 8 (D1) and 6 (D2), which is why a viewer that treats pad numbers as nets (EasyEDA's own) draws the overlap cut back")
	(tags "DFN NoLead Dual MOSFET Transistor")
